---
import { CONNECTIONS } from '@lib/features/issue-tracking';
import Keyed from './Keyed.astro';
---

<section class="border-t border-line" aria-labelledby="connected-title">
  <div class="wrap py-16 md:py-24 grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-12">
    <div class="lg:col-span-5">
      <h2 id="connected-title" class="h2">
        The same ACME-12, wherever the work goes next.
      </h2>
      <p class="prose mt-5 max-w-[46ch]">
        One key, one record. The board, the reports, the knowledge base and your agent all read the issue you just saw,
        not a copy of it.
      </p>

      <figure class="panel mt-8 it-agent" aria-label="An agent reading ACME-12">
        <p class="prompt">
          <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">
            ›
          </span>
          <span>Where did ACME-12 end up, and is anything still open on it?</span>
        </p>
        <ul class="calls">
          <li>
            <span class="tool">get_issue</span>
            <span class="args">issue: "ACME-12"</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="answer">
          <p>
            <strong class="font-medium">ACME-12</strong> Invite link blank after it expires is{' '}
            <strong class="font-medium">Fixed</strong>, resolved 8 Oct 2026, 4:40pm, assigned to Alex Lee. Severity
            Critical, 1h 45m spent of 2h.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Nothing is left open: its subtask ACME-13 and ACME-4, which it depends on, are both Fixed. The decision is
            in the article <em>Invitation links and expiry</em>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7 rule-list">
      {CONNECTIONS.map(item => (
        <div class="py-6">
          <h3 class="h3">{item.title}</h3>
          <p class="prose mt-2 text-base">
            <Keyed text={item.body} />
          </p>
          <p class="quote mt-3">{item.record}</p>
          <a class="link text-sm mt-4 inline-block" href={item.href}>
            {item.label}
            <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">
              →
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .it-agent {
    background: var(--bg-app);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .it-agent .calls {
    padding-bottom: 12px;
  }
</style>
